---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const headHtml = "<title>Privacy Policy | NotEnoughCoins</title>\n        <meta name=\"description\" content=\"How notenoughcoins.net processes data: hosting via Cloudflare, no analytics, no advertising, no non-essential cookies, and how this deviates from the general Coflnet GmbH privacy policy.\">\n        <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex\">\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://notenoughcoins.net/privacy\">";
const bodyHtml = "<main>\n            <div class=\"site-shell\">\n                <section class=\"policy-shell\">\n                    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>\n                    <p class=\"lede\">This page describes data processing on notenoughcoins.net specifically. It is a deviation/addition to the general Coflnet privacy policy, not a replacement for it.</p>\n\n                    <h2>Controller</h2>\n                    <p>Coflnet GmbH<br>Dorfstr. 27a<br>84163 Marklkofen<br>Germany<br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@coflnet.com\">support@coflnet.com</a></p>\n\n                    <h2>Relationship to the general Coflnet privacy policy</h2>\n                    <p>The general privacy policy of Coflnet GmbH at <a href=\"https://coflnet.com/privacy\">https://coflnet.com/privacy</a> applies. For this website, the following applies in addition to or as a deviation from that policy.</p>\n\n                    <h2>Hosting and server log files</h2>\n                    <p>This site is served through Cloudflare (Cloudflare, Inc., USA), which sits in front of our origin server as a reverse proxy and provides basic protection against abuse. Cloudflare processes standard connection metadata (IP address, requested URL, timestamp, user agent, referrer) to deliver the page and to protect it against attacks. Where this involves a transfer to the US, it is based on the EU-US Data Privacy Framework (DPF), with Standard Contractual Clauses as a fallback. Our own server logs record the same kind of request data. Log data is kept only as long as needed for security and troubleshooting purposes: typically 7 days, tracing data within about a week, with a hard ceiling of 30 days, after which it is deleted.</p>\n\n                    <h2>No analytics, no advertising, no non-essential cookies</h2>\n                    <p>This site does not run any analytics or tracking software (no Matomo, Google Analytics or similar), does not serve advertising, and does not set any non-essential cookies or comparable local storage. We do not use a cookie or tracking consent banner because there is nothing on this site that requires consent under § 25 TDDDG. Any cookies or storage strictly necessary for the site to function (if used at all) are exempt from that consent requirement.</p>\n\n                    <h2>Third-party content</h2>\n                    <p>Fonts and static assets on this site are served from our own domain; we do not load fonts, scripts or embeds from third-party origins on page load.</p>\n\n                    <h2>Outbound links</h2>\n                    <p>This site links to other Coflnet properties (for example sky.coflnet.com) and to third-party tools mentioned in our guides. Those destinations have their own, separate privacy policies, which we do not control.</p>\n\n                    <h2>Your rights</h2>\n                    <p>You have the right to access, correct, delete or restrict processing of your data, and to data portability, under the GDPR. To exercise any of these, contact <a href=\"mailto:support@coflnet.com\">support@coflnet.com</a>; we will respond within one month.</p>\n\n                    <h2>Supervisory authority</h2>\n                    <p>You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority. The authority responsible for Coflnet GmbH is:</p>\n                    <p>Bayerisches Landesamt für Datenschutzaufsicht (BayLDA)<br>Promenade 18<br>91522 Ansbach<br>Germany</p>\n\n                    <p>See also the <a href=\"https://coflnet.com/imprint\">Coflnet imprint</a>.</p>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </main>";
---

<Base headHtml={headHtml} bodyHtml={bodyHtml} />
